@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8007
@sessionId = 1
@orderId = 1

### Create an order (requires an ACTIVE customer session and available menu items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": {{sessionId}},
  "items": [
    {
      "menu_item_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "special_instruction": "Less spicy"
    },
    {
      "menu_item_id": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get an order by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Get all orders for a customer session (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/session/{{sessionId}}

### Delete an order (only works while status is ORDER_RECEIVED)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### cURL examples
# curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8007/orders -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"session_id\":1,\"items\":[{\"menu_item_id\":1,\"quantity\":2,\"special_instruction\":\"Less spicy\"},{\"menu_item_id\":2,\"quantity\":1}]}"
# curl http://127.0.0.1:8007/orders/1
# curl http://127.0.0.1:8007/orders/session/1
# curl -X DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8007/orders/1
